{"id":"n4-105","title":"～なくちゃいけない","romaji":"〜naku cha ikenai","jlptLevel":4,"shortExplanation":"Express the obligation to do something; 'have to', 'must', 'need to'.","longExplanation":"The ～なくちゃいけない grammar point is used to express that there is an obligation or necessity to do something. It can be translated as 'have to', 'must', or 'need to' in English. This grammar point is mainly used with verbs.","formation":"Verb-ない form (-ない ending is dropped) + なくちゃいけない","examples":[{"jp":"仕事に行かなくちゃいけないので、早起きしなければなりません。","romaji":"Shigoto ni ikanakucha ikenai node, hayaoki shinakereba narimasen.","en":"I have to go to work, so I must wake up early.","words":[{"surface":"仕事","vocabId":"1304970","reading":"しごと"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"行か","vocabId":"1578850","reading":"いく","baseForm":"行く"},{"surface":"なく","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ない"},{"surface":"ちゃ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いけ","vocabId":"1421700","reading":"いけ","baseForm":"いける"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ので","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"早起き","vocabId":"1400200","reading":"はやおき"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"なけれ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ない"},{"surface":"ば","vocabId":null},{"surface":"なり","vocabId":"1899440","reading":"なり","baseForm":"なる"},{"surface":"ませ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"ん","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4,5,6]},{"jp":"試験があるから、勉強しなくちゃいけません。","romaji":"Shiken ga aru kara, benkyou shinakucha ikemasen.","en":"I have a test, so I must study.","words":[{"surface":"試験","vocabId":"1312350","reading":"しけん"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ある","vocabId":"1296400","reading":"ある"},{"surface":"から","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"勉強","vocabId":"1512670","reading":"べんきょう"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"なく","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ない"},{"surface":"ちゃ","vocabId":